    EditorialLessonRecord("Class 9–10|School Practical Chemistry|Recording results and uncertainty",
        "new case",
        "A measurement record includes value, units, conditions and an uncertainty appropriate to the method.",
        "Repeated readings characterize random variation but do not automatically remove systematic bias. Instrument resolution is one uncertainty contribution, not always the entire uncertainty.",
